sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User / Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Server
    participant OBS as Observer Agent
    participant OPR as Operator Agent
    participant MCP as MCP Server (stdio)
    participant S as Slurm Cluster

    U->>API: HTTP POST /v1/chat/completions
    API->>OBS: Runner.run_streamed()
    OBS->>OBS: ReAct loop (Think → Act → Observe)
    OBS->>MCP: read tool call (squeue / sinfo / sacct…)
    MCP->>S: Execute command
    S-->>MCP: stdout / JSON result
    MCP-->>OBS: Tool response

    alt State-changing request
        OBS->>OPR: SDK handoff() with _OperatorHandoffPayload
        OPR->>MCP: discovery read (squeue / scontrol_show)
        MCP-->>OPR: target IDs resolved
        OPR->>API: needs_approval=True — interruption event
        API-->>U: SSE: pending_approval event
        U->>API: POST /confirm or /cancel
        API->>OPR: RunState.resume(approved=True/False)
        OPR->>MCP: Execute action tool
        MCP->>S: scancel / scontrol / sbatch…
        S-->>MCP: Result
        MCP-->>OPR: Tool response
        OPR->>OBS: SDK handoff() with results
        OBS->>OBS: Synthesise final response
    end

    OBS-->>API: Stream events (tool_call, reasoning, text_delta)
    API-->>U: SSE stream (OpenAI-compatible format)
